Backports the fix for https://rustsec.org/advisories/RUSTSEC-2026-0258.html (GHSA-q83h-524g-xf6h).
This backports hyperium/h2@193833e87c639e39751f339a9c375a44c8bfab54 to limit excessive/unbounded
empty and small DATA frames.

